---
/**
 * The Ritual — ivory editorial block: display + lead (2fr/1fr), then a
 * collage of photo / stat / photo. The 2× stat is the double daily
 * Happy Hour, counted up with GSAP.
 */
---

<section class="ritual horizon-motif" id="ritual" aria-labelledby="ritual-title">
  <div class="page-pad">
    <div class="ritual__head">
      <div>
        <p class="section-label" data-reveal>The Sunset Ritual</p>
        <h2 class="ritual__title display-copy" id="ritual-title" data-split>
          Golden hour is a daily ceremony here
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="ritual__lead lead-copy" data-reveal>
        At Horizons, sunset is not a moment — it is a ritual. The light turns,
        the first pour lands, and Eagle Beach slows into its warmest hour.
        We built the lounge around that pause, and we repeat it twice a day.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="ritual__collage" data-reveal-stagger>
      <div class="ritual__media" data-reveal-item data-image-reveal>
        <img
          src="/images/gallery/03.jpg"
          alt="Couple enjoying the sunset lounge atmosphere at golden hour"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="ritual__stat" data-reveal-item>
        <span class="ritual__stat-number"><span data-story-count="2">0</span>×</span>
        <p class="ritual__stat-caption">
          Happy Hour, every single day — 5:30–6:30 PM at sunset and again
          9:00–10:00 PM under the stars.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="ritual__media" data-reveal-item data-image-reveal>
        <img
          src="/images/drinks/signature-cocktail.jpg"
          alt="Signature cocktail served during golden hour at Horizons Lounge"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
